              "- Ask pupils if they remember the previous vocabulary about the topic “Our Tet holiday” – what people do to prepare for Tet.- Explain how the game is played. Have a pupil choose a gift, look at the picture, then choose an action that people will do for Tet. After each correct answer, pupils will open the gift to get the ingredients to make banh chung. Pupils keep answering questions to get enough ingredients. When pupils collect all the ingredients, they can make banh chung.- Have pupils read the words aloud.",
