              "- Pupils point at Picture a, listen to the recording and repeat the phrases Hoan Kiem Lake and by bus several times. Pupils follow the teacher’s instructions with Pictures b, c and d. Pupils repeat all the phrases.- Pupils listen to the question pattern and repeat it. Pupils follow the teacher’s instructions with the answer pattern.- Pupils point at the pictures and listen and repeat after the recording.- Pupils work into two groups to take turns repeating the questions and the answers for Pictures a - d.- Pairs of pupils practise asking and answering questions with the pictures. A few pairs point at the pictures and say the questions and the answers in front of the class."
