              "- Click to move the circle and reveal the picture. The pupil raising his/her hand first has a chance to guess the place.- Show the whole picture if the pupil guesses correctly. - Tell pupils that now they will learn more places.- Have pupils look at the pictures and repeat after the teacher.",
